      "word_count": 36,
      "duration_seconds": 13.6,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0074",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 479.67,
      "end_seconds": 483.55,
      "text": "Okay. Fine. What did you enter for his birth date?",
      "word_count": 10,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0075",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 484.05,
      "end_seconds": 487.79,
      "text": "July 21st 2014 yep,",
      "word_count": 4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0076",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 488.52,
      "end_seconds": 493.6,
      "text": "Correct. Okay. And mine is March 8th, 1954.",
      "word_count": 8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0077",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 494.96,
      "end_seconds": 497.44,
      "text": "that's right. I have that right there ma 'am",
      "word_count": 10,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0078",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 498.86,
      "end_seconds": 502.14,
      "text": "The certificate number had a zero or the letter O.",
      "word_count": 10,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0079",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 503.2,
      "end_seconds": 515.69,
      "text": "It was recorded as c dash t 4 4 9 1 0 8 with the digit 0 between 1 and 8",
      "word_count": 21,
      "duration_seconds": 12.49,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0080",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 516.82,
      "end_seconds": 520.36,
      "text": "Good. I always mix those two up over the phone.",
      "word_count": 10,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0081",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 520.8,
      "end_seconds": 527.78,
      "text": "Yes, I understand Uh, let's see the certificate applied successfully. So the identifier was accepted",
      "word_count": 16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.98,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0082",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 529.87,
      "end_seconds": 531.67,
      "text": "Can we choose the seats now?",
      "word_count": 6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0083",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 533.13,
      "end_seconds": 546.3,
      "text": "Um, the reservation is confirmed in standard economy Seat selection can be completed from the reservation screen So just choose two adjacent available seats and verify verify both directions for that. Okay?",
      "word_count": 32,
      "duration_seconds": 13.17,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0084",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 548.97,
      "end_seconds": 549.21,
      "text": "Okay.",
      "word_count": 1,
      "duration_seconds": 0.24,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": true
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0085",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 550.64,
      "end_seconds": 563.24,
      "text": "So I see 16A and 16B outbound and then 14D and 14E to return.",
      "word_count": 14,
      "duration_seconds": 12.6,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0086",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 563.61,
      "end_seconds": 570.03,
      "text": "Yes, those are adjacent pairs Just review the aircraft map before confirming because layouts can differ",
      "word_count": 16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0087",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 572.2,
      "end_seconds": 576.44,
      "text": "Okay. Confirmed. Does the walker need a serial number?",
      "word_count": 9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0088",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 577.22,
      "end_seconds": 586.16,
      "text": "No, ma 'am. Not for this reservation entry I would label it with contact information and identify it as a mobility device at the airport just so they're aware",
      "word_count": 30,
      "duration_seconds": 8.94,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0089",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 587.85,
      "end_seconds": 591.89,
      "text": "Okay. Please give me the total one more time.",
      "word_count": 9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0090",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 592.3,
      "end_seconds": 615.76,
      "text": "No problem That was one thousand one hundred and eighty six dollars forty cents for fare taxes and two checked bags Plus ninety four dollars and sixty cents for that insurance And a two hundred dollar credit was applied and the remainder was charged to the visa on file And that's the card I have ending in one one eight two",
      "word_count": 62,
      "duration_seconds": 23.46,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0091",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 617.72,
      "end_seconds": 619.68,
      "text": "Okay. That matches my screen.",
      "word_count": 5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0092",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 620.63,
      "end_seconds": 634.97,
      "text": "Great. Okay, ma 'am, and I do suggest just save the confirmation b nine r t 6 m And review the insurance document for exclusions",
      "word_count": 25,
      "duration_seconds": 14.34,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0093",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 636.3,
      "end_seconds": 641.05,
      "text": "I will. I, okay. I've written down the confirmation and the total.",
      "word_count": 13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0094",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 641.9,
      "end_seconds": 644.94,
      "text": "Good perfect. Is there anything else I can help you with today, ma 'am?",
      "word_count": 14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0095",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 645.75,
      "end_seconds": 649.29,
      "text": "No, that covers it. Thank you for being patient with me.",
      "word_count": 11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0096",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 650.01,
      "end_seconds": 656.87,
      "text": "Oh, you're very welcome ma 'am. It's my pleasure and thank you for choosing blue mesa airlines and have a wonderful trip with your grandson",
      "word_count": 27,
      "duration_seconds": 6.86,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0097",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 658.6,
      "end_seconds": 659.14,
      "text": "Thank you.",
      "word_count": 2,
      "duration_seconds": 0.54,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": true
    }
